# Project Gotham Racing 2 (4D53004B): one route. Instant Action writes no profile, so the path is the same on
# every boot. PLAYED by nav.py on the Thor, 2026-09-27 21:01 PDT (lane.titleroutes HELD session
# pgr2.first-run-20260927T210151), to gameplay.
#
#   Bizarre Creations logo, then the intro FMV (START skips) -> the title, "Play PGR 2 / PRESS START" (A held
#   400 ms) -> the menu: Start Player's Game (or Create New Profile) / Profile Manager / Instant Action / Xbox
#   Demos -> the hat held right 3 s (the menu auto-repeats and stops at Xbox Demos), then ONE hat tap left:
#   Instant Action (A) -> loading -> "Welcome to Florence" flyby, which ends by itself -> the race, LAP 1 of 2,
#   TIME 4:56.
#
# Why the menu moves are not counted: the menu auto-repeats and drops taps while it animates, and at 4 fps
# (cold) against 59 fps (warm) a counted route went elsewhere (sessions 6-7). Pushing to the stop and stepping
# back once does not depend on the rate. B, B, A after the first A puts either the title or the menu on the
# menu (B at the menu returns to the title; B at the title does nothing), in case the START landed early and
# the A only ended the FMV.
#
# The tap left is held 0.1 s: the replay of the nav session's 0.3 s hold stepped twice (to Profile Manager,
# scratch/replay/pgr2-210557).
#
# Player control: RT drove the car to 37 mph on the Florence street (nav frame s-009-gas, TIME 4:50). The
# pattern reverses, then drives with the stick left, right and centred. The triggers rest at `min`.
# Instant Action's clock is 5 min; after it, what follows is not seen.
wait 33.6
shot boot
wait 30.3
shot t1
wait 7.5
press START
wait 10.1
shot t2
wait 8.8
press A 400
wait 4
press B
wait 2
press B
wait 2
press A 400
wait 6.7
shot menu
wait 8.1
axis HATX max
wait 3.3
axis HATX mid
wait 2.1
shot end
wait 6.6
axis HATX min
wait 0.1
axis HATX mid
wait 2.1
shot ia
wait 10.2
press A
wait 30.2
shot go
wait 24.6
shot load2
wait 8.3
mark gameplay
repeat forever {
    axis RT min
    axis LT max
    wait 2.5
    axis LT min
    axis RT max
    axis LX min
    wait 2.5
    axis LX max
    wait 2.5
    axis LX mid
    wait 2
    axis RT min
}
